<title>USA: Emulex Q2 shr profit $0.08 vs loss $0.49.</title>
<headline>Emulex Q2 shr profit $0.08 vs loss $0.49.</headline>
<text>
<p>COSTA MESA, Calif., Jan 23 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			  EMULEX CORP. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>	     Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>		    (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    Dec. 29,	Dec. 31,</p>
<p>							1996	    1995</p>
