<p>Note: Net loss for the six months ended Dec. 29, 1996, included a charge of $1,280 related to the company's prior quarter consolidation of operations, tax-related interest income of $238 and a $342 federal income tax benefit related to a recovery under a tax-sharing agreement with QLogic Corp. (a former subsidiary of the company).  Excluding these nonrecurring items, net of tax, net income would have been $142, or $0.02 per share.</p>
